  "details": "I wasn’t around in the time webpages could be used, but I think it would be neat to re-enable the ability to take advantage of more than just video playback.\n\nAdding the ability to use a whitelisted set of services from inside VRChat such as Discord, Twitter, etc would be very useful! \n\nIf done right it could add a whole new way to communicate with people, especially considering trying to type or see media in the Discord app while using VR.\n\nAdding the ability to mount API and similar services (whiteliested ones to prevent malicious uses) to both worlds and avatars would be a useful feature for creators.",
